[signal arg="mood_tension"]
join mangver (Thinking) center
mangver (Thinking): Matatawag mo bang ebidensya yan, Mosa?
mangver (Thinking): Ikaw pa, na sanay na sanay sa chismis dito —
mangver (Thinking): dapat alam mo agad na hindi yan credible..
join mangver (ThinkingSad) center
mangver (ThinkingSad): Hindi man lang nila pinakinggan ang side ni Delfin.
# DM-015: flavor choice only. No condition/variable/trust mutation -- all three
# options funnel to the same next line. Matches dm013_choice_smoke.dtl's
# pattern; satisfies CODING.md §4 (trust is private to GameState, mutated by
# exactly two methods, neither of which applies here) and CANON #10/#11 (no
# choice in this game silently branches state without being the one sanctioned
# Chismis It decision, and this isn't it).
- Ay, teka— may punto ka rin naman.
- Pero sabay-sabay silang nag-post, e!
- Kaya nga po tinakbo kita agad, di ba?
mangver (ThinkingSad): Hindi ko na kaya palampasin ang mga tsismis
mangver (ThinkingSad): na lalo lang kumakalat sa baranggay natin.
mangver (ThinkingSad): Lalo na't may nasaktan na dahil dito.
# DM-015 fix (real-render finding, DialogueBox's own dev-console safety net fired
# here first: "beat exceeds 2 lines (got 3)"): split at the "..", per mosa-narrative's
